WEBVTT

00:34.360 --> 00:35.960
In the World Beyond,

00:36.360 --> 00:38.400
humans take Potions

00:39.120 --> 00:41.520
to gain various Beyonder powers

00:41.800 --> 00:44.560
and advance to higher Sequences
in a Pathway.

00:46.080 --> 00:48.360
All 22 Pathways

00:48.760 --> 00:50.680
begin from Sequence 9,

00:51.480 --> 00:53.320
and the lower the Sequence number is,

00:53.840 --> 00:56.120
the stronger the Beyonder powers.

00:57.360 --> 00:59.000
A High-Sequence Beyonder

00:59.560 --> 01:02.720
can possess powers
comparable to a deity.

01:03.760 --> 01:06.360
And such Pathways

01:07.360 --> 01:09.600
are Pathways to Divinity.

01:18.740 --> 01:24.128
(Hoy University)

01:38.760 --> 01:39.600
(Red chimneys...)

01:40.840 --> 01:44.040
(No more clues could be divined
since last time.)

01:44.760 --> 01:46.920
(Even the gray mist
couldn't pierce the interference.)

01:48.040 --> 01:49.856
(The mastermind is formidable.)

01:51.000 --> 01:52.000
(Advancing to Clown)

01:52.600 --> 01:54.640
(and better hidden cards
are both what I need.)

01:56.160 --> 01:57.000
(For weapons,)

01:57.280 --> 01:58.120
(except firearms,)

01:58.440 --> 01:59.480
(I have only charms.)

02:00.800 --> 02:01.640
(Charms?)

02:02.080 --> 02:02.920
(Right.)

02:03.280 --> 02:04.120
(Flaring Sun Charm's crafting)
(Flaring Sun Charm.)

02:05.480 --> 02:06.400
(I need to find a way)

02:06.800 --> 02:09.040
(to exploit that drop
of Eternal Blazing Sun blood.)

02:09.560 --> 02:10.400
Klein.

02:12.720 --> 02:13.560
Mr. Azik.

02:14.680 --> 02:15.600
Are you busy lately?

02:16.320 --> 02:17.600
You look exhausted.

02:19.080 --> 02:21.320
I've been tracking
the mastermind constantly.

02:21.600 --> 02:22.480
I'm a bit anxious.

02:23.200 --> 02:25.000
Since detecting my surveillance,

02:25.480 --> 02:26.680
he hasn't shown further flaws.

02:28.120 --> 02:28.960
Relax a bit.

02:29.200 --> 02:30.080
Don't obsess too much.

02:30.920 --> 02:33.080
Breakthroughs often come
when least expected.

02:36.200 --> 02:37.040
I understand,

02:37.120 --> 02:37.960
Mr. Azik.

02:46.840 --> 02:47.680
Mr. Azik,

02:48.280 --> 02:50.480
I'd like to ask you

02:51.640 --> 02:52.480
for a favor.

02:54.716 --> 02:57.696
=Episode 8=
(Derailment: We Are Guardians)

03:15.200 --> 03:16.576
(Roselle's Diary)

03:17.960 --> 03:18.840
(Unnamed island?)

03:19.680 --> 03:20.520
(What's this?)

03:21.680 --> 03:23.160
I'm very sorry, Mr. Fool.

03:23.480 --> 03:24.320
This week,

03:24.320 --> 03:26.120
I couldn't acquire
new Roselle's Diary pages.

03:27.000 --> 03:27.840
Don't mind.

03:28.440 --> 03:30.800
This endeavor requires patience.

03:34.720 --> 03:35.600
However, recently,

03:35.600 --> 03:37.792
I've connected
with some secret Beyonder circles

03:38.120 --> 03:39.712
and might obtain more diary pages.

03:40.240 --> 03:42.528
Honorable Mr. Fool and Mr. Hanged Man,

03:44.160 --> 03:45.000
I wish to

03:45.080 --> 03:46.920
obtain information
about secret organizations.

03:50.280 --> 03:51.360
(Don't look at me.)

03:52.000 --> 03:53.760
(The omniscient Fool in front of you)

03:54.080 --> 03:55.560
(is actually bronze-tier.)

03:58.520 --> 04:00.224
These organizations operate covertly

04:00.224 --> 04:01.720
and lurk in shadows.

04:01.720 --> 04:03.160
I only know fragments.

04:03.840 --> 04:06.600
I need to investigate
through contacts for more.

04:07.400 --> 04:08.280
That'll be complicated

04:08.800 --> 04:10.000
and extremely dangerous.

04:10.440 --> 04:12.520
Just share what you know then.

04:12.640 --> 04:13.560
Even so,

04:14.120 --> 04:16.000
the price remains steep.

04:16.000 --> 04:17.720
P-Price?

04:18.240 --> 04:20.640
Meaning what?

04:24.920 --> 04:25.760
A thousand pounds.

04:26.360 --> 04:27.680
Used bills, not in sequence.

04:29.240 --> 04:30.200
(A thousand pounds?)

04:31.320 --> 04:33.280
(Enough for a mansion in Tingen.)

04:33.400 --> 04:34.680
(Just for mere fragments?)

04:35.080 --> 04:35.960
(That's robbery.)

04:37.840 --> 04:39.560
(Though Miss Justice is noble,)

04:39.640 --> 04:41.520
(she can't offer that easily.)

04:45.480 --> 04:46.320
No problem.

04:48.240 --> 04:49.760
Same delivery address as before?

04:53.240 --> 04:54.080
Mr. Hanged Man?

04:58.160 --> 04:59.000
Correct.

04:59.440 --> 05:00.600
Same address

05:01.240 --> 05:03.600
and same recipient.

05:04.880 --> 05:05.920
(So loaded?)

05:06.200 --> 05:07.680
(Handing out a thousand casually.)

05:09.632 --> 05:11.120
(Stay calm, Zhou Mingrui.)

05:11.360 --> 05:12.200
(It's just money.)

05:12.960 --> 05:14.800
(Maintain Mr. Fool's dignity.)

05:16.760 --> 05:18.600
You may go on, Mr. Hanged Man.

05:20.000 --> 05:20.840
Currently,

05:20.920 --> 05:22.640
major secret organizations

05:22.720 --> 05:23.640
number over a hundred.

05:24.400 --> 05:26.440
Those dating from the Fourth Epoch

05:26.440 --> 05:27.520
(include the Secret Order,)

05:27.800 --> 05:28.640
(the Demoness Sect,)

05:28.800 --> 05:30.000
(and the Moses Ascetic Order.)

05:30.680 --> 05:32.840
(Moses Ascetic Order is the oldest.)

05:33.480 --> 05:34.600
(Their Pathway)

05:35.120 --> 05:37.240
starts with Sequence 9, Mystery Pryer.

05:37.640 --> 05:39.040
(Old Neil's Sequence Pathway?)

05:40.120 --> 05:42.280
Members of this organization
worship knowledge itself.

05:42.960 --> 05:45.400
They revere it as the Hidden Sage.

05:46.080 --> 05:48.520
The early Moses Ascetic Order
was highly respected.

05:49.160 --> 05:51.320
But now it's degenerated
into an evil organization.

05:52.200 --> 05:55.040
Why? Worshiping knowledge isn't evil.

05:55.200 --> 05:56.120
But what if

05:56.760 --> 05:58.360
knowledge itself became alive?

06:00.320 --> 06:02.880
Rumors say the Hidden Sage came alive.

06:04.000 --> 06:04.840
"He"

06:05.120 --> 06:07.000
became a personified evil god.

06:08.360 --> 06:11.000
This epoch's start saw the birth
of the Rose School of Thought

06:11.480 --> 06:13.240
and the Death-worshiping
Numinous Episcopate.

06:13.792 --> 06:15.320
They came from the Southern Continent.

06:16.480 --> 06:18.400
Aurora Order, Element Dawn,

06:18.400 --> 06:19.560
and Psychology Alchemists

06:20.040 --> 06:21.840
emerged only in recent centuries.

06:23.720 --> 06:26.080
Thank you for the information,
Mr. Hanged Man.

06:27.160 --> 06:29.280
Mr. Fool, I have no further questions.

06:29.640 --> 06:32.160
Good. Let's conclude today's meeting.

06:32.920 --> 06:34.400
- As you wish.
- As you wish.

06:44.600 --> 06:46.280
(Death-worshiping Numinous Episcopate?)

06:46.840 --> 06:48.600
(It feels related to Mr. Azik.)

06:51.400 --> 06:52.840
(It'd been days. The favor I asked)

06:53.000 --> 06:54.360
(of Mr. Azik makes no progress.)

06:54.960 --> 06:56.000
(Did he forget?)

06:56.960 --> 06:59.440
A bizarre paranormal case
erupts at the docks today.

06:59.720 --> 07:02.040
Is it a purge targeting
Evernight Goddess devotees?

07:02.200 --> 07:03.320
Or is there hidden truth?

07:03.320 --> 07:04.160
Hello.

07:07.200 --> 07:08.400
Pardon me, sir?

07:10.496 --> 07:12.360
Wait. I'll buy a newspaper.

07:17.320 --> 07:18.160
Watch out.

07:18.720 --> 07:19.560
Benson?

07:19.920 --> 07:20.760
Melissa?

07:21.040 --> 07:23.080
Why are you back so early?

07:23.760 --> 07:24.600
Klein,

07:24.920 --> 07:25.760
is that

07:25.840 --> 07:26.680
a gun?

07:27.160 --> 07:28.000
Well...

07:28.000 --> 07:28.840
Actually...

07:30.120 --> 07:32.440
I'm working as an historical consultant
for the police now.

07:32.720 --> 07:33.760
The gun is an issued item.

07:34.320 --> 07:35.280
I'll be home late.

07:35.560 --> 07:36.440
Eat dinner without me.

07:38.120 --> 07:39.520
Did something good happen to Klein?

07:40.080 --> 07:41.240
He looks so cheerful.

07:50.200 --> 07:51.040
(No casualties.)

07:51.680 --> 07:53.120
(Targeting Evernight believers?)

07:53.920 --> 07:55.440
(It must be Mr. Azik's doing.)

07:57.160 --> 07:58.360
What's the hurry?

07:58.520 --> 07:59.880
You never visit.

08:00.040 --> 08:01.120
Now that you're here, stay.

08:01.960 --> 08:03.040
(Mr. Neil and...?)

08:03.040 --> 08:04.544
(Folan, Mandated Punishers, Lord of Storms,
Sequence 8: Folk of Rage, Sailor Pathway)

08:04.680 --> 08:05.520
It's him.

08:05.520 --> 08:07.160
I told you I'm on duty.

08:08.200 --> 08:09.840
Duties never end.

08:10.040 --> 08:11.800
Learn to steal leisure from duties.

08:12.600 --> 08:14.840
Wright, two Southville beers.

08:14.920 --> 08:15.800
He's paying.

08:15.800 --> 08:18.160
Old coot. Always mooching drinks.

08:18.160 --> 08:19.960
Mr. Neil, hello.

08:21.200 --> 08:23.120
Klein, what a coincidence!

08:23.760 --> 08:25.480
Wright, one more drink.

08:25.720 --> 08:26.600
Still...

08:27.560 --> 08:28.400
I know.

08:28.600 --> 08:29.520
He pays.

08:32.120 --> 08:33.440
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

08:37.400 --> 08:38.240
Great!

08:38.800 --> 08:39.840
Chugging so fast?

08:39.960 --> 08:41.760
Choke, and I won't save you.

08:43.240 --> 08:45.160
Here about the dock incident?

08:45.520 --> 08:47.400
Yes. It's really weird.

08:47.760 --> 08:48.960
Ghosts discriminated by faith,

08:49.280 --> 08:50.680
only targeting Evernight devotees.

08:51.160 --> 08:53.040
And the dock area
is Mandated Punishers' turf.

08:53.160 --> 08:54.240
Rumors are running wild.

08:54.800 --> 08:56.200
I need to meet with Dunn.

08:57.240 --> 08:58.640
Mandated Punishers and Nighthawks

08:59.000 --> 09:01.000
can't let rumors breed discord
between them.

09:01.400 --> 09:02.960
Or those evil guys would laugh.

09:03.640 --> 09:05.760
Do you suspect evil organizations?

09:06.840 --> 09:08.120
The initial investigation shows

09:09.120 --> 09:10.480
they weren't Storm followers.

09:10.720 --> 09:12.240
We can't investigate further.

09:12.920 --> 09:13.760
But...

09:13.760 --> 09:15.880
Lanti Proof. Fill it up.

09:17.520 --> 09:19.920
Those spirits are ancient
and hard to banish.

09:20.360 --> 09:22.040
Their forms look archaic,

09:22.040 --> 09:24.200
like Fourth Epoch ghosts.

09:25.840 --> 09:27.640
(Mr. Azik's involvement is confirmed.)

09:28.280 --> 09:30.120
(Time for me to step up.)

09:30.360 --> 09:32.040
Let me toast you both.

09:36.120 --> 09:36.960
Bottoms up!

09:39.280 --> 09:40.360
I've got duties.

09:40.760 --> 09:42.160
Next time at the bar by the docks,

09:42.440 --> 09:44.280
let's drink till dawn, Old Neil.

09:45.800 --> 09:46.720
By the way,

09:46.960 --> 09:48.120
you're Klein, right?

09:48.760 --> 09:51.200
I knew you were special from the start.

09:51.800 --> 09:52.760
How about you

09:52.960 --> 09:54.160
join the Mandated Punishers?

09:54.160 --> 09:56.440
Alright, get going now.

09:56.880 --> 09:57.720
Neil,

09:58.120 --> 09:59.640
you owe me two rounds today.

09:59.920 --> 10:01.200
Next time pay me back double.

10:02.200 --> 10:03.040
I'm off.

10:04.440 --> 10:06.240
Mr. Folan's quite a straightforward man.

10:08.240 --> 10:09.680
Just another drunkard.

10:11.760 --> 10:12.680
Sorry to interrupt.

10:13.920 --> 10:14.760
Old Neil,

10:15.000 --> 10:15.840
Captain needs you.

10:19.080 --> 10:20.880
The paranormal case
in the dock area is fishy.

10:21.440 --> 10:22.560
You know that area better.

10:23.200 --> 10:24.760
Leonard and Kenley lack experience.

10:25.760 --> 10:27.080
Go handle it with them.

10:27.920 --> 10:28.760
Me?

10:29.920 --> 10:31.600
Captain, let me go.

10:32.440 --> 10:34.120
For an emergent case of weird spirits,

10:34.480 --> 10:36.360
divination should prove helpful.

10:37.400 --> 10:40.520
Exactly. Let the youngsters handle this.

10:41.640 --> 10:44.480
My old back can't take it anymore.

10:44.680 --> 10:45.840
There's a new regulation now.

10:46.400 --> 10:48.680
There is a double mission allowance
for those over 50.

10:50.600 --> 10:52.680
Klein's suggestion makes sense.

10:52.960 --> 10:56.000
I'll help him
properly use divination for tracking.

10:56.840 --> 10:57.680
Stay cautious.

10:58.080 --> 10:58.960
Don't act recklessly.

10:59.680 --> 11:00.520
Understood,

11:00.520 --> 11:01.360
Captain.

11:02.200 --> 11:03.040
Captain.

11:03.280 --> 11:04.840
I heard the spirits are hard to handle.

11:05.360 --> 11:07.400
Any efficient way to banish them?

11:08.520 --> 11:09.360
For this purpose,

11:10.640 --> 11:12.240
only 3-0782 is suitable.

11:13.960 --> 11:15.040
Mutated Sun Sacred Emblem.

11:16.080 --> 11:18.240
We exorcised
the castle's wraiths in a minute.

11:18.640 --> 11:19.720
If this time...

11:19.880 --> 11:20.720
No.

11:22.520 --> 11:23.680
The dock area is too crowded.

11:23.840 --> 11:25.080
It's too risky to deploy it.

11:25.800 --> 11:27.040
If civilians are present,

11:27.320 --> 11:29.000
they'll turn into

11:29.120 --> 11:30.680
sun-worshipping fools within an hour.

11:32.400 --> 11:33.680
It's indeed tricky.

11:34.080 --> 11:34.920
However,

11:35.360 --> 11:37.160
we must prepare
for worst-case scenarios.

11:37.480 --> 11:40.240
If there's a powerful Wraith
among those ghosts...

11:40.600 --> 11:41.440
Also,

11:41.440 --> 11:42.640
it's Mandated Punishers' turf.

11:43.000 --> 11:44.640
If we can't
control the situation in time,

11:44.960 --> 11:46.640
we'll have to return for your backup.

11:46.880 --> 11:49.160
The Nighthawks' reputation

11:49.560 --> 11:50.880
might suffer irreparably.

11:56.240 --> 11:58.400
Fine. But stay alert.

11:59.040 --> 12:01.400
Don't linger anywhere over an hour.

12:02.440 --> 12:04.120
Understood, Captain.

12:06.707 --> 12:09.600
(Lord of Mysteries)

12:10.771 --> 12:12.085
(Secret Organizations)

12:12.085 --> 12:13.405
(Born in the Fourth Epoch.)

12:13.405 --> 12:16.035
(It includes Demoness Sect,
Rose School of Thought, Aurora Order, etc.)

12:27.400 --> 12:30.280
You schemed to partner
with me intentionally, didn't you?

12:32.680 --> 12:34.960
But abandon your delusions.

12:35.440 --> 12:36.720
Even during missions,

12:37.160 --> 12:39.200
you won't uncover my secret.

12:41.040 --> 12:43.360
(No one is interested
in your secret, bro.)

12:44.040 --> 12:45.560
(Don't be so narcissistic, okay?)

12:47.200 --> 12:50.160
Are you four Nighthawks?

12:51.200 --> 12:52.040
Yes.

12:52.960 --> 12:53.800
Greetings, officers.

12:53.800 --> 12:56.080
I-I've long admired the Nighthawks.

12:57.080 --> 12:59.240
I'm Gate, the new sheriff
for the dock area.

12:59.640 --> 13:01.320
Follow me, please.

13:04.160 --> 13:05.920
Multiple paranormal cases reported.

13:06.120 --> 13:08.160
This is the worst spot.

13:09.320 --> 13:10.528
Who're these people?

13:10.528 --> 13:12.608
Must be exorcists.

13:12.608 --> 13:13.760
Exorcists?

13:13.760 --> 13:15.000
Fancy-looking men like that

13:15.440 --> 13:18.040
are only seen in politicians' laps
or noblewomen's arms.

13:18.280 --> 13:19.120
Can he do it?

13:20.352 --> 13:22.400
The middle two are just kids.

13:23.440 --> 13:24.520
That's Old Neil.

13:24.600 --> 13:25.640
Heard he's got skills.

13:25.920 --> 13:28.000
Skills? He's ancient.

13:28.160 --> 13:29.080
Might get possessed

13:29.240 --> 13:30.400
instead of banishing ghosts.

13:31.520 --> 13:32.400
Enough nonsense!

13:32.400 --> 13:33.880
Everyone, just disperse!

13:37.560 --> 13:38.400
Too many people here.

13:38.880 --> 13:39.960
Will your abilities

13:40.200 --> 13:41.520
be hindered?

13:44.200 --> 13:45.080
Rest assured.

13:45.480 --> 13:46.600
We're professionals.

13:47.280 --> 13:48.440
For this exorcism,

13:48.520 --> 13:49.640
we've prepared holy water,

13:49.840 --> 13:51.520
a sacred emblem,

13:51.760 --> 13:52.600
and...

13:52.600 --> 13:53.440
garlic.

13:53.840 --> 13:54.840
The newspaper said these

13:55.240 --> 13:56.800
are essential for exorcism rituals.

13:57.960 --> 13:59.280
They actually know their stuff.

13:59.920 --> 14:00.760
(Perfect.)

14:01.040 --> 14:02.880
(Nighthawks are now snake oil salesmen.)

14:03.640 --> 14:05.320
Emperor Roselle once said

14:05.320 --> 14:07.360
form must surpass substance.

14:10.320 --> 14:12.760
No time to waste. Let's begin.

14:56.760 --> 14:57.600
Sheriff Gate,

14:57.720 --> 14:58.840
mobilize backup immediately!

15:02.840 --> 15:03.680
Woof!

15:09.240 --> 15:10.760
(Mr. Azik's haunting act)

15:10.920 --> 15:12.360
(is vivid enough.)

15:18.840 --> 15:19.680
(Bro,)

15:19.920 --> 15:21.000
(commit to the act.)

15:21.000 --> 15:22.040
(Don't blow my cover.)

15:23.360 --> 15:24.200
Everyone, be careful!

15:26.480 --> 15:27.520
The spirits are unusual.

15:27.880 --> 15:28.960
Restrain the possessed ones

15:29.280 --> 15:30.240
for one more minute.

15:33.120 --> 15:34.640
(3-0782 is taking effect.)

15:58.880 --> 15:59.760
Thank goddess.

16:00.080 --> 16:01.200
It was a minor incident.

16:02.120 --> 16:02.960
Next,

16:03.280 --> 16:04.400
our exorcist

16:04.480 --> 16:05.840
will officially start the ritual

16:06.280 --> 16:07.320
to purge the evil spirits.

16:08.280 --> 16:09.720
Why me?

16:12.480 --> 16:13.320
A rookie privilege.

16:20.200 --> 16:22.320
The Evernight Goddess
stands higher than the cosmos

16:22.560 --> 16:25.000
and more eternal than eternity.

16:26.040 --> 16:28.480
The Evernight Goddess
stands higher than the cosmos

16:28.680 --> 16:32.680
and more eternal than eternity.

16:34.960 --> 16:36.960
Lady of Crimson.

16:37.280 --> 16:39.160
Mother of Concealment.

16:40.080 --> 16:42.800
Empress of Misfortune and Horror.

16:43.400 --> 16:46.960
Mistress of Repose and Silence.

16:47.920 --> 16:49.240
I beseech your power

16:50.040 --> 16:51.320
to purge these evil spirits.

16:52.280 --> 16:53.240
Will this work?

16:54.280 --> 16:55.440
Such a warm sensation.

16:55.680 --> 16:57.640
Yes, like basking in sunlight.

16:57.960 --> 16:58.840
Truly miraculous!

17:00.560 --> 17:02.080
A professional exorcist indeed.

17:02.640 --> 17:03.520
Praise the goddess.

17:11.200 --> 17:12.040
Hurry up.

17:24.000 --> 17:24.840
Are you alright?

17:32.800 --> 17:33.920
(Mr. Folan?)

17:37.400 --> 17:39.280
H-He kicked me!

17:40.560 --> 17:42.016
Thank you, sir.

17:42.016 --> 17:43.160
You've saved our lives.

17:43.800 --> 17:45.240
May our Lord bless you.

17:45.720 --> 17:47.880
(Her mental state has improved.)

17:48.400 --> 17:50.000
(Her family has accepted the child?)

17:53.000 --> 17:53.840
Folan?

17:54.280 --> 17:55.720
Weren't you on an urgent task?

17:55.920 --> 17:57.120
Why are you wandering here?

17:59.480 --> 18:00.320
She's my task.

18:00.840 --> 18:02.560
I need to watch this poor girl

18:02.800 --> 18:04.320
to track down her fiancé

18:04.760 --> 18:05.880
Lanevus' whereabouts.

18:07.400 --> 18:08.680
Lanevus?

18:09.240 --> 18:11.720
The scammer
with over 10,000 pounds involved?

18:13.040 --> 18:15.640
We're checking for Beyonder involvement.

18:16.160 --> 18:17.040
Nothing found, though.

18:17.920 --> 18:18.840
They'll likely

18:19.040 --> 18:20.960
classify it as regular fraud
within days.

18:25.400 --> 18:27.920
Drink less before you drown your liver.

18:28.680 --> 18:29.680
Death by alcoholism?

18:32.480 --> 18:33.920
Sounds like a perfect exit.

18:35.280 --> 18:36.120
See you.

18:40.520 --> 18:41.360
Mr. Neil,

18:42.000 --> 18:43.600
you seem quite close with Mr. Folan.

18:46.040 --> 18:47.800
We're old Tingen hands.

18:48.000 --> 18:50.000
Time binds us tight.

18:50.560 --> 18:52.040
Our old crew used to

18:52.120 --> 18:55.080
drink and sing at my place.

18:55.680 --> 18:58.960
And Celeste would play piano for us.

18:59.480 --> 19:00.320
Celeste?

19:02.640 --> 19:03.760
She was my wife.

19:04.920 --> 19:07.600
She died years ago.

19:08.120 --> 19:09.720
From our entire group,

19:09.880 --> 19:13.120
only Folan and I remain.

19:16.320 --> 19:17.920
Don't make that face.

19:18.320 --> 19:20.880
Death is but peaceful slumber.

19:21.320 --> 19:23.000
For folks like us,

19:23.280 --> 19:25.040
not dying from derailment

19:25.400 --> 19:27.040
is divine mercy.

19:27.920 --> 19:30.960
Now go cleanse the remaining spirits.

19:31.360 --> 19:32.440
Make haste.

19:33.160 --> 19:35.680
I'll sit this one out.

19:48.480 --> 19:49.760
All cleansed.

19:50.640 --> 19:51.840
How peculiar.

19:52.080 --> 19:53.200
The spirits were resilient.

19:53.760 --> 19:55.760
Yet the hosts are unharmed.

19:56.480 --> 19:58.320
First time witnessing this.

20:00.040 --> 20:01.320
Divine the cause of this.

20:02.400 --> 20:03.240
No problem.

20:04.640 --> 20:05.632
(The cause of the paranormal case
at the docks)

20:08.000 --> 20:09.760
The cause of the paranormal case
at the docks.

20:14.240 --> 20:15.800
No divination results?

20:17.000 --> 20:17.840
As expected.

20:18.480 --> 20:20.040
Mr. Azik's elevated status

20:20.440 --> 20:21.280
blocks all readings

20:21.640 --> 20:23.240
unless he allows it.

20:34.560 --> 20:36.360
You probably
saw the Southern Continent's

20:36.680 --> 20:37.520
inverted pyramid.

20:38.200 --> 20:40.320
Whether in East or West Balam
or Highlands Kingdom,

20:40.760 --> 20:42.320
only those claiming descent from Death

20:42.760 --> 20:44.640
could construct such a grand mausoleum.

20:45.160 --> 20:46.000
Death?

20:46.760 --> 20:48.240
The evil that allied
with Primordial Demoness

20:48.600 --> 20:50.960
to unleash Pale Disaster
across the Northern Continent?

20:51.400 --> 20:52.880
Followers of Death?

20:53.840 --> 20:55.160
What's their scheme in creating

20:55.800 --> 20:56.800
the evil spirit event?

20:58.040 --> 21:00.920
(Mr. Azik awakened
amidst piles of corpses.)

21:01.480 --> 21:03.160
(Was it the Pale Disaster's
battlefield?)

21:04.160 --> 21:06.240
(If Mr. Azik truly
is a descendant of Death,)

21:06.800 --> 21:09.320
(then the mastermind
stealing his child's skull)

21:09.760 --> 21:10.840
(is even more concerning.)

21:12.040 --> 21:12.880
That's it for now.

21:13.560 --> 21:14.440
As usual, next,

21:14.960 --> 21:16.560
one person will guard with 3-0782

21:16.920 --> 21:17.880
while others rest.

21:18.320 --> 21:19.160
Rotate shifts hourly.

21:20.560 --> 21:21.920
(Finally, the moment arrives.)

21:31.200 --> 21:34.440
(Evernight Goddess charms
requiring silver were expensive enough.)

21:34.960 --> 21:36.000
(This thing's crazier,)

21:36.240 --> 21:37.080
(consuming gold.)

21:39.000 --> 21:40.000
(Must succeed in one shot.)

21:48.360 --> 21:50.280
Blood of the Eternal Blazing Sun.

21:51.000 --> 21:52.840
Inextinguishable Light.

21:53.440 --> 21:54.840
Embodiment of Order.

21:55.640 --> 21:57.120
God of Contracts.

21:58.160 --> 21:59.560
Guardian of Businesses.

22:00.880 --> 22:02.480
I beseech you...

22:06.400 --> 22:07.280
I beseech you

22:07.800 --> 22:10.040
to grant me power
to complete the Flaring Sun Charm.

22:18.880 --> 22:20.760
Blood of the Eternal Blazing Sun,

22:21.680 --> 22:22.920
please channel your might

22:23.440 --> 22:25.040
into this charm.

22:46.800 --> 22:48.200
Strange weather.

23:50.640 --> 23:51.480
Beyonder

23:51.760 --> 23:52.600
derailment?

24:09.320 --> 24:10.160
Be careful.

24:10.360 --> 24:11.760
It was at least Sequence 8 before.

24:12.680 --> 24:14.080
We must eliminate it in the ship.

24:14.680 --> 24:16.520
We can't let it reach
the Tussock River again.

24:18.200 --> 24:19.440
Take 3-0782 and evacuate first.

24:21.440 --> 24:22.280
Kenley!

24:24.640 --> 24:25.480
Go!

24:30.160 --> 24:31.000
No pushing!

24:31.240 --> 24:33.040
This way! This way!

24:33.600 --> 24:34.640
Evacuate them quickly.

24:34.880 --> 24:36.760
Maintain a 50-meter security perimeter.

24:37.320 --> 24:38.160
Understood.

24:38.320 --> 24:39.600
Find a way to alert Folan.

24:39.800 --> 24:41.680
Do not approach without orders.

26:08.240 --> 26:10.360
What kind of aerial pendulum is this?

26:50.360 --> 26:51.200
No!

26:58.000 --> 26:58.960
This actually worked?

27:01.960 --> 27:02.800
Nocturnal

27:03.360 --> 27:04.200
Slumber.

27:17.920 --> 27:19.680
The threat of fear.

27:20.360 --> 27:21.720
Crimson hope.

27:22.200 --> 27:24.600
At least one thing is true.

27:42.680 --> 27:43.720
Folan.

27:44.600 --> 27:45.760
Mr. Folan?

27:50.640 --> 27:53.280
He's completely derailed.
He can't be saved.

28:02.400 --> 28:03.240
I'll handle it.

28:11.600 --> 28:13.520
Mr. Neil, your hand...

29:57.160 --> 29:59.000
(Old Neil always seemed cheerful,)

29:59.760 --> 30:01.280
(yet his home feels so dull)

30:01.720 --> 30:02.560
(and lifeless.)

30:06.760 --> 30:08.840
(Old Neil's wife,)

30:09.880 --> 30:11.000
(Ms. Celeste?)

30:15.760 --> 30:16.920
(Mr. Folan)

30:18.440 --> 30:19.280
(was perfectly fine.)

30:20.080 --> 30:21.640
(Why would he derail so suddenly?)

31:14.560 --> 31:15.880
Whether drinking together

31:16.480 --> 31:17.920
or meeting at the docks,

31:18.640 --> 31:19.800
he showed no abnormalities.

31:21.760 --> 31:23.160
In such a brief time,

31:23.600 --> 31:25.560
what caused his derailment?

31:27.480 --> 31:28.960
If undetectable beforehand,

31:30.080 --> 31:31.320
then Beyonder derailment

31:32.240 --> 31:34.360
is far more terrifying than imagined.

31:36.520 --> 31:37.880
With two Flaring Sun Charms

31:39.640 --> 31:40.960
empowered by divine blood,

31:41.440 --> 31:43.480
I should be able to counter
both the notebook's lure

31:43.800 --> 31:45.160
and the mastermind.

31:46.440 --> 31:47.600
But these life-saving cards

31:49.000 --> 31:50.440
can't prevent Beyonder derailment.

31:52.000 --> 31:52.840
Captain said

31:53.360 --> 31:55.400
most Nighthawks die from derailment.

31:56.440 --> 31:58.400
Then, I, Captain, and others...

31:59.720 --> 32:01.680
are we doomed to the same fate?

32:05.200 --> 32:06.040
Nonsense!

32:07.040 --> 32:08.640
I even exploited divine power.

32:09.360 --> 32:10.640
There's always a solution.

32:13.800 --> 32:14.680
Perhaps

32:15.520 --> 32:17.184
better self-control

32:17.184 --> 32:18.480
and stronger Beyonder powers

32:19.320 --> 32:20.640
could reduce derailment risk?

32:21.640 --> 32:22.800
Maybe it's time to reveal

32:23.240 --> 32:24.800
the acting method to my teammates.

32:25.680 --> 32:26.600
And it's time

32:27.120 --> 32:28.320
to advance to Clown.

33:15.444 --> 33:20.625
♪Burn my broken shell to new sight♪

33:21.418 --> 33:29.184
♪To be free in mist
to hold a cup of light♪

33:29.463 --> 33:32.832
♪Where are the flames
that come in fury?♪

33:33.046 --> 33:36.256
♪Where are the keys
that carve truth from me?♪

33:36.470 --> 33:42.048
♪Into the dark
to dream and scream my name♪

33:42.048 --> 33:45.248
♪Wonder or dismay♪

33:45.248 --> 33:48.874
♪Madness or decay♪

33:49.398 --> 33:51.454
♪With fragile light♪

33:51.454 --> 33:55.520
♪I vow to guard a world I stay♪

33:55.520 --> 33:59.183
♪Stirring or delay♪

33:59.183 --> 34:02.496
♪Rebirth or be same♪

34:03.063 --> 34:08.330
♪With whispers in gray
guide my shadow way♪

34:08.599 --> 34:12.160
♪Fade away♪
